              "name": "t:names.text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>And what cloth it is; cloth which, the more closely you examine it, the better it gets. Donegal writ through. The yarn is alive with tufts of unexpected shades, from off-white to auburn. It is lambswool, softer than one might assume, and fairs mightily well in the wet and the windy.</p>",
